  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: LastSignal.Runtime::LastSignal.Interaction.NoteInteractable
  id: l1_sticky
  title: Sticky note by the keypad
  body: 'Changed the code again.

    Same rule as always: the time the last person signed OUT on the storm night.


    I never want to forget it.

    - Dad'
